{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>Ascribe</b> — he explained what the voice that HaShem spoke is: \"Ascribe strength,\" to give praise in speech." "<b>upon Israel</b> — for they are His treasure from all the earth; upon them His majesty is seen." "<b>and His strength is in the skies</b> — for from there the strength for Israel will come."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 68, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:17.484146267Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}